[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Numero Dos</h2>
<i>"Wanna play 52 card pickup?"<br>
--My older sister tormenting me when I was younger</i>  
<p>~B~E~iHere we have a nice little map set up. You've got a workshop, a generator, and a golem.
<p>Think you're so smart huh?  See if you can figure this one out.  (This is not terribly difficult.)

$Button=More,Tell,More

[More]
<h2>~wBlah blah blah...</h2>
<p>~B~E~q   Ok basically with this map I just wanted to do something different.  The heart of this level is a simple puzzle set up at the start.  The map also highlights a kind of nice group of pop up windows from which you can pick your weapons.  Your island will supply you with plenty of storm power, and theres only two computers, neither of which are very difficult.
                                                         -Mike Byrne aka Australian_Dingo
$Button=I cant wait to get started!,Tell,More2

[More2]
<p>
~i"Don't put all your eggs in one basket."
~l---Old saying

